{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4309172761dd7b4384cf581b690cd46f02823d79045967e579f5d1cbeca10b75",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c21ebca70d5a3ea97dfc734da81b54bf8a9d1cff0d5af206b53acbbdeabbfab",
      "text": "独自看的大海，大家看的大海",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7ecfe1ef96a67447a682ee39231f0823e6e4c26481ebf8a923366f9f21a098",
      "text": "生日当天，克里斯一如往常从大清早就潜入大海，\n感受其美丽。收到来自家人和\nLegenders成员们的祝福信息，\n如沐浴朝阳的海面般闪耀璀璨的\n特别的一天拉开了序幕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c21ebca70d5a3ea97dfc734da81b54bf8a9d1cff0d5af206b53acbbdeabbfab",
      "text": "独自看的大海，大家看的大海",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f4a1070513236cf74333c2a704752a522049cf43ebbeb600e0ec37572c6e532",
      "text": "天空还是一片漆黑。……看来比预定的时间\n要早到了不少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f6a92ee4449f2e3698da4c0b7852e45224c4d9c21d1201c90a3945ce305bbc",
      "text": "距离日出还有一段时间，\n先去潜水吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000055:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa3aee3043d9743bdf8350762b53a3a6a6f0fd2511a11a4d2285ab909658dd83",
      "text": "哎呀，潜水期间太阳已经升起来了吗。\n太沉迷于观察生态，完全没注意到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b2223aa532325fe5bee99e0fdc1da88a867be390694490ad8bccc54c75265f",
      "text": "话说回来，今早的大海显得格外美丽呢。\n是因为对我而言是特别的日子吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4adb7d55b45adea82ba8d5588772d1c188aef4c3671911c0aa1c3d459aa27dd7",
      "text": "……唔。身体稍微有点着凉了呢。\n用太阳的光芒来暖暖身子吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076be7c91365eb481a26e8bc10b631c463be1c4b08d582cc516d70781ebe7338",
      "text": "“非常感谢。晚餐前我会回家的。\n聚餐我很期待哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7953c2d7ee5cb60a77cb9e82c496023f84acfa5cd259a8aa27d9653e50f37879",
      "text": "（能得到家人的生日祝福，\n无论经历多少次都是令人高兴的事呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63a9a7e88b04f9627c7efdb22936f34cef0849043b404b6ddf0304b17bf6cb4a",
      "text": "雨彦和想乐，连制作人也发来了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebc8dfee841c356f83cfe617cd3bab4d16fbeff7114a45b93ef98221767c3f6",
      "text": "（“祝你生日快乐”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71421f7c54f1bde5e4a056690f30b2a9da18cb043095092c2809ab1dc6fa533d",
      "text": "（“准备了礼物。\n下午能顺道来一趟事务所吗”，这样吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dc13258f6fcdb960b68b893f6eccc92c985eb24aada658389b10f1abf9f709c",
      "text": "（成为偶像之后，为我庆祝生日的人\n变多了。……真的很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b8225f6703e2e33dcce1d8eb7001470d96b0f87b83b7c6bc21fa37804ba78c",
      "text": "“非常感谢。那么，确认好到达时间后\n我会联络您的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93eb5633e074269c8b67f525109bcab0be5eb9e20866411966194f37b13f96cf",
      "text": "身体已经暖和起来了，再去海里潜一次水，\n然后再去事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80428e3de7c93d8f930d8e637c1e894e3b5f6145a004ce408b7c8e7a94a5b9b2",
      "text": "（哎呀。克里斯先生已经回复了～。\n今年肯定也泡在海里吧～。问问看吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ee4bb388661322d166eefe041ae9eef0eef3a1623e7864a4cdbe31d1793ffb1",
      "text": "（“早上好～。你现在在海边吗～？”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3513deeb5bf96953b0e179fcf51a70a0b988c5a0a9f741c9169cf03484a8760f",
      "text": "（果然在海边啊～。啊，照片发过来了。\n克里斯先生就算过生日也和平时没两样呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f9cb0156ec06245238cbd20deba305a39da85ac796c567b8630cfe537359c6",
      "text": "（回复一句“大海的照片，谢谢啦～”吧。今天稍微有些\n忙，得尽早行动起来才行了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000092:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d9e83aa9ceff81365aca00b13170561c0d97784446ecb5712811a8202db0036",
      "text": "雨彦的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd3d4d09f322988eb517277589f1074568f80cce3b5fe8771366c536cea231df",
      "text": "嗯？……是古论啊。看来注意到信息了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37c4fc494237b8ae631a311e9dd2225580c9a3517994c5094255e9a45962b701",
      "text": "嚯，在海边啊。\n很有古论风格的过生日方式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393cd8e8b5f5f5aa29eb48a3ce3020493c072bfa22baaf20d0a4c5add54a382d",
      "text": "（“真是漂亮的大海照片啊。天气不错，\n真是再好不过了”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8249aee3935e72c21ccbbdbb3ec8e3af96f80c4c3175049b13a6a68cf08a6a40",
      "text": "……好啦，打扫也做完了，\n差不多该准备出门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ff7d05252d4556301219c3c5de14369b97b97c7fb976f0c67947fdc7951a25b",
      "text": "哎呀，●●●●プロデューサー也发来回复了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:296b179002ed64d40c6f2a98d76e7ee6338e82b357312181381b6c262c7d2f13",
      "text": "（“发送的照片，\n能让您感到开心，我也很高兴”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a140477f4197f536f1007f8520b1baf0f0c9df4db4854e09f8a79d3dbc716610",
      "text": "能有像这样畅谈大海的同伴，\n真是件幸事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b9e9551e1f39b6fcde98ad0442c8ddbf685ceaf31a62417ec19772406e01c8f",
      "text": "（映入我眼帘的这幅景色，此刻也正传递给\n雨彦、想乐，以及制作人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fda63e1b249aa91f5af126da82ebb6f4a61a61c418f47c0aeb40c4943e50d73b",
      "text": "（即便身处不同地点、各自度过时光，\n也能像这样分享这份感动……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:357d946a4710dae9c3eb5d7a02fc92fc9bc2edf93e8b4cf1a4626338ccf3808c",
      "text": "（看来我果然，\n遇到了非常棒的一群人呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7c2e5ee5273d455ad98ac9f8aa2d0503025e29336970bdf154d45d56e55a75",
      "text": "……总有一天，就算不是我的生日也没关系，\n我想和制作人、雨彦、想乐一起看海。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fd40ffaa6a39e30b910c45031d634691e855fe6b2d82e1a7ff15fe3b926bb9c",
      "text": "看来时间还很充裕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ba129bb57a34dd41931f9d663ac010c668b5d3a5572e8cee14dad4a1ac2a87",
      "text": "必须把这个值得纪念的日子里美丽的大海英姿，\n更深刻地烙印在眼底才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3e0686c6318b0b098b8eddff33efd924d5dd3334e8e6d72fbfb42fa9a67eb6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー托我买的蛋糕，\n我已经取回来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:506f46202c408f2acffd98589116e1d5e8a564e3f32898b3d059b8337fcb549e",
      "text": "谢谢您！\n因为工作被拖延了，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d1ce7c051c08e62e0f739318e71291976e267212b2f2e994d59eb586f5645a",
      "text": "顺便办我自己的事而已，不用介意。\n不如说，能帮上忙就很好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf45d0bfa40a44f64a4b40320913a64cb203d5fafcbd185da6b56d35705b44fc",
      "text": "雨彦先生，回来了啊～。欢迎回来～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6217a7480fedca3492f89f1a3dd44f956cc1a90843c62f661db33faf29c88955",
      "text": "我这边已经准备好了哦～。话虽如此，\n也就只是把盘子和杯子摆出来而已啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cd7a8558d9623f053f9f59b1d7817b0dc7654d721b05a8439074c42213448a",
      "text": "（……不过，我自己做着这种事也真是不像我的作风）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858d5d151c827a2299fab1cf3635cfc2d0b8a05ce63ba44697775ecbd577b234",
      "text": "（像这样给克里斯先生庆祝，\n至今还是觉得有点不可思议呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68a7ef858b8f0de60adfa4085bfff978ee195d6b88d3b01e7704a671c133214f",
      "text": "（该说是不太习惯呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:471d656b3e75e1b9707e3cd4c432666f0263171cc9c1441637aaaed043effd76",
      "text": "（毕竟他那么高兴嘛。\n嘛，每年看一次那种表情倒也不坏）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b722b8ece267acc8398893ca1d2a01669d53e14434ce9f8661faadb593534a4",
      "text": "差不多到克里斯先生要来的时间了呢！\n我去拿饮料过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8e9f5837901f8d25b3bfc21161af4a1fdebb3a8984d984bcc6ff96b92abe51b",
      "text": "啊啊，拜托啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df37f36d8d781631b0615fb1768e721519326dcd910ab0ee89957233f4a128f6",
      "text": "（看来正好能在\n跟各位约好的时间赶到呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92ba61cab6c9176dd1defe8406d7c32d8d4b8edeac8a98546af62851e24fd4d8",
      "text": "让各位久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d36897e0d5343f8d776b7be674162bbe405619a896ee4f22b12398d4e5f20742",
      "text": "主角登场了啊。\n生日快乐，古论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ed5367aaeab0f1230acce0dd7fd99df1df1459f527e9279e73554b71421c36",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐～，克里斯先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000076:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed24b6ba8c106d134023c1f67c3b60dd1acb4d4247c7d07abe7ef6b60653e41",
      "text": "克里斯先生，祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000076:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e3a810edd6cb3f9bd1f42815e8ab112a57d109a132d66a9d180efcd907c5bf3",
      "text": "谢谢各位……！能够为我准备\n这样的场合，我真的非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25c8ab6fd7ceccb7e0382658a5e08c44b6d91a1a7744ca0ed211d12ce69ee2d",
      "text": "你能开心，我们也觉得很高兴哦～\n制作人，能把那个交给他吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbacb8afd3141814078f5280d5bb9a0d541db206c44b123d165c85d70b5b3b97",
      "text": "好的！克里斯先生，这是生日礼物。\n请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddcdbfe1738479dbe0970011649471a6337a1329d4a8312a1fd256dd37515892",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n今年会是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1920e83751dc2c8fa5ece9a6883a110b06665f798ae04420b38a6726a675fa2",
      "text": "先坐下，再慢慢确认吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bb7cab0e5a765dc8c966d12e14ab2a3375d0875556b7f6ea1d6dedb39985080",
      "text": "这是我们3个人一起挑的哦～\n要是能合你心意，那就太好了～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_e:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45681ac36f93876262f76960bf3d62493a528368b8e2fd4eaa7aba1ccd5dddb",
      "text": "好的，那当然一定会合我心意的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
